{
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "taptap-reserve",
      "name": "TapTap 预约榜",
      "role": "internal",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://www.taptap.cn/webapiv2/app-top/v2/hits?type_name=reserve",
      "tier": 2,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 60,
      "headers": {
        "X-UA": "V=1&PN=WebApp&LANG=zh_CN&VN_CODE=102&LOC=CN&PLT=PC&DS=Android&UID=&OS=Android",
        "Referer": "https://www.taptap.cn/top/reserve"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.list",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.taptap.cn/app/{app.id}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "app.title"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "app.description"
          ],
          "image": [
            "app.icon.url"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "reserve": "app.stat.reserve_count",
          "fans": "app.stat.fans_count",
          "reviews": "app.stat.review_count"
        }
      },
      "note": "引进信号最强：全部是未上线新游。必须带 X-UA 指纹头（不是签名，写死即可），缺了返回 INVALID_XUA。榜单无发布时间，released_time 未上线恒为 0。每页 10 条，total 150。链接直连站内游戏页 /app/{app.id}（实测 200 且标题正确）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "taptap-hot",
      "name": "TapTap 热门榜",
      "role": "internal",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://www.taptap.cn/webapiv2/app-top/v2/hits?type_name=hot",
      "tier": 2,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 60,
      "headers": {
        "X-UA": "V=1&PN=WebApp&LANG=zh_CN&VN_CODE=102&LOC=CN&PLT=PC&DS=Android&UID=&OS=Android",
        "Referer": "https://www.taptap.cn/top/download"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.list",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.taptap.cn/app/{app.id}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "app.title"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "app.description"
          ],
          "image": [
            "app.icon.url"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hits": "app.stat.hits_total",
          "fans": "app.stat.fans_count",
          "reviews": "app.stat.review_count"
        }
      },
      "note": "安卓热门榜。站内数据比外部热榜丰富：stat 里还有 rating.score、review_count、feed_count、video_count、wish_count、album_count。榜单无时间戳，做「新进榜」只能两次快照 diff。"
    },
    {
      "id": "taptap-pop",
      "name": "TapTap 热玩榜",
      "role": "internal",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://www.taptap.cn/webapiv2/app-top/v2/hits?type_name=pop",
      "tier": 2,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 60,
      "headers": {
        "X-UA": "V=1&PN=WebApp&LANG=zh_CN&VN_CODE=102&LOC=CN&PLT=PC&DS=Android&UID=&OS=Android",
        "Referer": "https://www.taptap.cn/top/played"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.list",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.taptap.cn/app/{app.id}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "app.title"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "app.description"
          ],
          "image": [
            "app.icon.url"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hits": "app.stat.hits_total",
          "fans": "app.stat.fans_count",
          "reviews": "app.stat.review_count"
        }
      },
      "note": "热玩榜＝近期在玩，比累计人气更贴近「现在火」。同一接口换 type_name 还能拿 24 个榜：new/sell/in_app_event_reserve/exclusive/action/strategy/idle/single/casual/sandbox_survival/management/unriddle/shooter/multiplayer/acgn/music/scenario/swordsman/otome/independent/roguelike。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bilibili-ranking",
      "name": "B站全站热门排行",
      "role": "community",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://api.bilibili.com/x/web-interface/ranking/v2?rid=0&type=all",
      "tier": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 60,
      "headers": {
        "Referer": "https://www.bilibili.com/v/popular/rank/all/",
        "Origin": "https://www.bilibili.com",
        "Cookie": "buvid3=E50C7143-D01C-B776-D8BF-A34B59FE6AC415020infoc"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.list",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/{bvid}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "title"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "desc"
          ],
          "image": [
            "pic"
          ],
          "publishedAt": [
            "pubdate"
          ],
          "author": [
            "owner.name"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "views": "stat.view",
          "danmaku": "stat.danmaku",
          "likes": "stat.like",
          "replies": "stat.reply"
        }
      },
      "note": "必须带 buvid3，否则 code=-352（是风控不是 403）。这个 buvid3 是机器指纹不是登录态，可随时用公开接口 https://api.bilibili.com/x/frontend/finger/spi 的 data.b_3 换新。不需要 wbi 签名。100 条固定无分页，pubdate 是真实发布时间（跨度约 4 天，属于「近几日综合热门」）。榜单混有大量非游戏内容，游戏条目靠 tname 判断——这正是破圈信号。⚠️ 不用 rid=4（游戏区）：2026-10-23 复核仍是冻结快照（96 条全落在 2025-03-28~2025-04-02），会静默污染时效。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zhihu-hot",
      "name": "知乎热榜",
      "role": "community",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://api.zhihu.com/topstory/hot-list?limit=50",
      "tier": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 30,
      "headers": {},
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "target.title"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "target.excerpt"
          ],
          "image": [
            "children.0.thumbnail"
          ],
          "publishedAt": [
            "target.created"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hot": "detail_text",
          "answers": "target.answer_count",
          "followers": "target.follower_count"
        },
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/{target.url|lastPathSegment}"
      },
      "note": "走 api.zhihu.com 移动端接口，无需 cookie；www.zhihu.com 的 v3 接口要 z_c0（401）。⚠️ 链接由 target.url 尾段拼成 www.zhihu.com/question/<id>——target.id 是 JSON 数字，19 位超 2^53 会丢精度，必须用字符串里的 id。"
    },
    {
      "id": "douyin-hot",
      "name": "抖音热点榜",
      "role": "community",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://www.douyin.com/aweme/v1/web/hot/search/list/?device_platform=webapp&aid=6383&channel=channel_pc_web&detail_list=1&source=6",
      "tier": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 30,
      "headers": {
        "Referer": "https://www.douyin.com/"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.word_list",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.douyin.com/search/{word}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "word"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "publishedAt": [
            "event_time"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hot": "hot_value",
          "videos": "video_count",
          "discussions": "discuss_video_count"
        }
      },
      "note": "不需要 a_bogus/X-Bogus 签名，实测裸 GET 就 200。event_time 是榜单事件时间（本次 0.4~44.8h 前），是外部热榜里少数带真时间戳的。只有话题词没有原文链接，所以拼 douyin.com/search 搜索链接（/hot/{sentence_id} 是 SPA 空壳，别用）。trending_list 是另一套上升榜，这里没取。"
    },
    {
      "id": "weibo-hotsearch",
      "name": "微博热搜",
      "role": "community",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://weibo.com/ajax/side/hotSearch",
      "tier": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 30,
      "headers": {
        "Referer": "https://weibo.com/",
        "Accept": "application/json, text/plain, */*"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.realtime",
        "urlTemplate": "https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q={word}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "word"
          ],
          "url": [],
          "summary": [
            "note"
          ],
          "image": [
            "icon"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hot": "num",
          "pos": "realpos"
        }
      },
      "note": "无需 cookie，只要 Referer。只有话题词没有原文链接，拼 s.weibo.com 搜索链接（该搜索页无 cookie 常被踢到 passport，正文要另想办法）。rank 字段恒为 0，排序用 realpos。data.hotgovs 是政务要闻置顶，没取。无任何时间戳。"
    },
    {
      "id": "baidu-hot",
      "name": "百度热搜",
      "role": "community",
      "region": "cn",
      "type": "json",
      "url": "https://top.baidu.com/api/board?platform=pc&tab=realtime",
      "tier": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "intervalMin": 30,
      "headers": {
        "Referer": "https://top.baidu.com/"
      },
      "adapter": {
        "path": "data.cards.0.content",
        "urlTemplate": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd={word}",
        "map": {
          "title": [
            "query",
            "word"
          ],
          "url": [
            "url"
          ],
          "summary": [
            "desc"
          ],
          "image": [
            "img"
          ]
        },
        "heat": {
          "hot": "hotScore"
        }
      },
      "note": "用 platform=pc 的 JSON 接口（platform=wise 那个没有 hotScore）。heat 取 hotScore（字符串 \"7903979\" 已被数字兜底转成 7903979，千万级）。item.url 是百度自家搜索跳转（rsv_dl=fyb_news），不是原文直链。desc 摘要质量高，很多时候能省一次正文抓取。"
    }
  ]
}
